{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37783","headline":"巴江 · 郑谷","name":"巴江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乱来奔走巴江滨，愁客多於江徼人。\n朝醉暮醉雪开霁，一枝两枝梅探春。\n诏书罪己方哀痛，乡县徵兵尚苦辛。\n鬓秃又惊逢献岁，眼前浑不见交亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37783.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37783","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}